# Elusive Otter's restriction is about creatures blocking *it* (CR 509.1b): as a blocker it is unrestricted. 
# Bot2's Cathar Commando (power 3) attacks and Bot1's Otter (power 1) may block it, even though the
# Otter's power is less than the attacker's. The Otter dies and the Commando (3/1) takes 1 and dies too.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Elusive Otter
Island x18

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Cathar Commando
Plains x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Elusive Otter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Cathar Commando.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Cathar Commando > Bot1)
Bot1.Block(Elusive Otter > Cathar Commando)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Elusive Otter
Bot2.Graveyard = Cathar Commando
